{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52130","headline":"假作屏风诗 · 上官仪","name":"假作屏风诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿叶霜中夏，红花雪里春。\n去马不移迹（《诗格》作「足」），来车岂动轮（《诗格》作「尘」）。\n（此首爲直言志）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}